<title>INDONESIA: Du Pont to buy stake in Branta.</title>
<headline>Du Pont to buy stake in Branta.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian tyre cord manufacturer PT Branta Mulia said on Thursday U.S.-owned chemical giant Du Pont planned to buy a 19.91-percent stake, or 44,800,000 shares, in the company.</p>
<p>&quot;E.I. Du Pont De Nemours and Company is proposing to purchase a stake in PT Branta Mulia,&quot; Branta Mulia said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Du Pont will buy the shares at $1.45 per share.</p>
<p>The statement did not give further details.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom 6221 384-6364</p>
